  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon ground cinnamon",
    "2 teaspoons baking soda",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground allspice",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.125 teaspoon ground cloves",
    "1.5 cups dark brown sugar",
    "0.75 cup sour cream",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "4 large eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "3 cups freshly grated carrots",
    "1 cup chopped pecans",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "0.5 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "2 teaspoons lemon juice",
    "2 cups confectioners' sugar, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line 18 muffin cups with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e--_RgcjokPLrYNFNZ2cYKzsEYk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4285440-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-cream-cheese-frosting-DDMFS-Step-01-529aaf0f811943b58b4f41902f1cf19a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/285440/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, cinnamon, baking soda, baking powder, allspice, salt, nutmeg, and cloves together in a large mixing bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rVeK3UiqYE_mfvk2jVwafCgWI90=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4285440-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-cream-cheese-frosting-DDMFS-Step-02-c7a65ced40c1426fa9d77337e9d7338d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/285440/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix brown sugar, sour cream, white sugar, vegetable oil, eggs, and vanilla together until smooth; add to flour mixture and stir until just combined. Stir in carrots, then fold in pecans. Divide batter evenly between the prepared muffin cups, filling 2/3 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-OqwDCjOgNFcBlveMYciWSHM2wk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4285440-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-cream-cheese-frosting-DDMFS-Step-03-337eb56c65d843b1bd180b9b89c3aef9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/285440/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean, 17 to 20 minutes. Cool in the tin for 10 minutes. Transfer to a wire rack and let cool completely, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/K-Ki-Dm-gdrzP409KZ2c0DRQW0g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4285440-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-cream-cheese-frosting-DDMFS-Step-04-16020d3917554f41a45aad12bcfea3aa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/285440/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frosting: Beat cream cheese, butter, vanilla, and lemon juice in a mixing bowl with an electric mixer until smooth. Add confectioners' sugar, a bit a time, until smooth and desired sweetness is achieved.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gZqJJbaEd_zGUBFijERmbp3rc34=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4285440-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-cream-cheese-frosting-DDMFS-Step-05-ab28521a92de4d0f8334e8a91ca1d5d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/285440/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread onto cooled cupcakes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I6-CLI1sWyA6C-Nix2nIH5eOzyM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4285440-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-cream-cheese-frosting-DDMFS-Step-06-7f3599da887c485280cf9a9ce68d6d02.jpg"
      ],
